{"id":297,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"探究とBJメンターで学ぶ一貫教育","feature_description":"日本大学豊山女子中学校は6年間一貫教育の中で、数学や理科の探究学習、卒業研究発表などを行います。大学での学びに触れる機会や社会人講話を通じ、将来を考えるキャリア教育にも取り組みます。放課後の自習室「BJメンター」は年間200日開室し、在校生が学習を支え合う機会も設けています。中学1年は数学、中学2年は理科の探究授業を行い、中学3年は卒業研究を発表します。","clubs":[{"id":4431,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.buzan-joshi.hs.nihon-u.ac.jp/junior/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":4432,"name":"ソフトテニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.buzan-joshi.hs.nihon-u.ac.jp/junior/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":4433,"name":"ソフトボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.buzan-joshi.hs.nihon-u.ac.jp/junior/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":4435,"name":"体操部（トランポリン）部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.buzan-joshi.hs.nihon-u.ac.jp/junior/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":4436,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.buzan-joshi.hs.nihon-u.ac.jp/junior/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":4437,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.buzan-joshi.hs.nihon-u.ac.jp/junior/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":4438,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.buzan-joshi.hs.nihon-u.ac.jp/junior/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":4439,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.buzan-joshi.hs.nihon-u.ac.jp/junior/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":4440,"name":"陸上競技部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.buzan-joshi.hs.nihon-u.ac.jp/junior/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":4441,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.buzan-joshi.hs.nihon-u.ac.jp/junior/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":4442,"name":"イラスト創作部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.buzan-joshi.hs.nihon-u.ac.jp/junior/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":4443,"name":"英語部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.buzan-joshi.